{%- comment -%}
  03 — REAL CAUSE
  Reframe: willpower (a moral failing) -> a missing rule (a structural gap).
  Belief installed: "You don't have a willpower problem. You have a missing filter."
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign s = section.settings -%}
<section class="ascend-section cause-{{ section.id }}" aria-labelledby="cause-{{ section.id }}-h">
  <div class="ascend-wrap">
    {%- if s.eyebrow != blank -%}
      <p class="ascend-eyebrow">{{ s.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    <h2 id="cause-{{ section.id }}-h" class="cause-{{ section.id }}__h">{{ s.heading }}</h2>

    <div class="cause-{{ section.id }}__grid">
      <div class="cause-{{ section.id }}__col cause-{{ section.id }}__col--old">
        <p class="cause-{{ section.id }}__label">{{ s.old_label | default: 'The story you were sold' | escape }}</p>
        <div class="cause-{{ section.id }}__body">{{ s.old_body }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="cause-{{ section.id }}__col cause-{{ section.id }}__col--new">
        <p class="cause-{{ section.id }}__label">{{ s.new_label | default: 'What is actually true' | escape }}</p>
        <div class="cause-{{ section.id }}__body">{{ s.new_body }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {%- if s.payoff != blank -%}
      <p class="cause-{{ section.id }}__payoff">{{ s.payoff }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

{%- style -%}
  .cause-{{ section.id }} {
    background: var(--ascend-bg, #0B0D10);
    color: var(--ascend-body, #C4CAD3);
    padding-block: var(--ascend-pad-block, 5rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ascend-line, rgba(255,255,255,0.09));
  }
  .cause-{{ section.id }}__h {
    font-family: var(--ascend-sans);
    color: var(--ascend-ink, #EDF0F3);
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 5vw, 2.7rem);
    line-height: 1.16;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    max-width: 20ch;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .cause-{{ section.id }}__grid { display: grid; gap: 1rem; }
  .cause-{{ section.id }}__col {
    padding: 1.4rem 1.4rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--ascend-line, rgba(255,255,255,0.09));
    border-radius: var(--ascend-radius, 12px);
    background: var(--ascend-surface, #161A20);
  }
  .cause-{{ section.id }}__col--old { opacity: 0.82; }
  .cause-{{ section.id }}__col--new { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ascend-accent, #34B98C) 45%, transparent); }
  .cause-{{ section.id }}__label {
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    color: var(--ascend-muted, #8C94A0);
  }
  .cause-{{ section.id }}__col--new .cause-{{ section.id }}__label { color: var(--ascend-accent, #34B98C); }
  .cause-{{ section.id }}__body { font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .cause-{{ section.id }}__body p { margin: 0 0 0.85rem; }
  .cause-{{ section.id }}__body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .cause-{{ section.id }}__col--old .cause-{{ section.id }}__body { color: var(--ascend-muted, #8C94A0); }
  .cause-{{ section.id }}__payoff {
    margin: 2.2rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--ascend-serif, Georgia, serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 3.6vw, 1.85rem);
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--ascend-ink, #EDF0F3);
    max-width: 26ch;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .cause-{{ section.id }}__payoff strong { color: var(--ascend-accent, #34B98C); font-weight: 650; }
  @media (min-width: 700px) {
    .cause-{{ section.id }}__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; align-items: start; }
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "03 Real Cause",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "ascend-shell",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Name it correctly" },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "<p>You don't have a willpower problem. You have a missing filter.</p>"
    },
    { "type": "text", "id": "old_label", "label": "Left column label", "default": "The story you were sold" },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "old_body",
      "label": "Left column body",
      "default": "<p>Be more disciplined. Want it more. Journal your feelings. Meditate before the open.</p><p>So every red day becomes a referendum on your character — and 'try harder' is a plan that fails at the exact moment you need it.</p>"
    },
    { "type": "text", "id": "new_label", "label": "Right column label", "default": "What's actually true" },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "new_body",
      "label": "Right column body",
      "default": "<p>Willpower is a battery. It's flat by the third re-test of a level. You can't summon it on command — nobody can.</p><p>What you're missing isn't grit. It's a pre-committed rule that answers 'is this a trade?' before you're emotionally in the position to lie to yourself.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "payoff",
      "label": "Payoff line",
      "default": "<p>A rule doesn't get tired. <strong>Build the 'no' once, and it holds every session after.</strong></p>"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "03 Real Cause" }]
}
{% endschema %}
